Package: EKQDA
Title: Computer-Assisted Qualitative Data Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Eric", "Kasper", , "erick@humanity-consultancy.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Tools for computer-assisted qualitative data analysis in R. Text
    documents, codes, coded segments and memos are stored in a single SQLite
    database. Functions are provided to import documents, define and apply
    codes, retrieve coded segments, and compute code frequencies and code
    co-occurrence matrices. An interactive 'shiny' application offers a
    graphical interface for coding, memo writing, retrieval and export.
